   "versionNonce": 700182,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the command queue           a lock-free ring buffer: many network threads\n                            produce, one application thread consumes\nPhaseStatus transitions     compare-and-set, so two recovery workers\n                            racing on one transfer resolve to one winner\nRaft internals              leader election and log replication",
   "originalText": "the command queue           a lock-free ring buffer: many network threads\n                            produce, one application thread consumes\nPhaseStatus transitions     compare-and-set, so two recovery workers\n                            racing on one transfer resolve to one winner\nRaft internals              leader election and log replication",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 806,
   "width": 1019,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100027,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700189,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "apply() runs only AFTER raft.propose() commits. Applying before commit would let the leader's in-memory state reflect an event\nthat a subsequent election discards - the same hazard the message queue's high watermark prevents. State must never run ahead\nof the committed log.",
   "originalText": "apply() runs only AFTER raft.propose() commits. Applying before commit would let the leader's in-memory state reflect an event\nthat a subsequent election discards - the same hazard the message queue's high watermark prevents. State must never run ahead\nof the committed log.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
